		},
		{
			"id":"36ad0b4f18c09644",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**God of this world** according to the entirety of Torah.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":15310,
			"y":1445,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"3bffd271930374bc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"But not THE God.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":15620,
			"y":1445,
			"width":180,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"623150d8fddb8ae8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Created the desired state for mankind that Yahweh then destroys. Yeshua then restores us to that state again in Revelation 22.",
